{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.72]So alone\n[00:06.52]Count the money while my lonely (Money while my lonely)\n[00:09.46]I ain't really fucking with the police (I ain't really fucking with the police)\n[00:12.82]And you know I keep it on me (And you know I keep it on me)\n[00:15.60]I ain't really fucking with the-\n[00:17.14]I ain't really fucking with the police\n[00:21.58]Enviyon on the mix\n[Chorus]\n[00:22.80]She told me she in love with the old me\n[00:26.64]But I don't love the old me\n[00:28.24]In the fourth quarter, balling like Kobe\n[00:32.36]I'm super clutchin' like Ginóbili\n[00:34.82]Time is money, so I went and got a rollie\n[00:38.30]New girl looking like a trophy\n[00:41.14]She do the cocaine till her nose bleed (Nose bleed, nose bleed)\n[00:44.74]And she don't even know me (And she don't know me, know me)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.14]I've been balling while you sitting in the nose bleeds\n[00:49.92]9-1-1, I don't fuck with police\n[00:53.20]Niggas claim they know me when they don't know me\n[00:56.22]Sayin' you a real nigga, better show me, ayy\n[00:59.80]I don't fuck with no one (Ayy)\n[01:02.36]Brother locked up, told you that's that Akon (Ayy)\n[01:04.96]I got AKs feelin' like I'm Osam, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:09.22]Pop a Xan then I forgot, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:12.60]I forgot to remember her name\n[01:14.60]Life is a picture, I guess I got my head in the frame (Head in the frame, head in the frame)\n[01:18.78]I forgot to remember her name\n[01:20.76]Life is a picture and I got all my hands in the frame\n[Chorus]\n[01:23.94]She told me she in love with the old me\n[01:27.80]But I don't love the old me\n[01:29.92]In the fourth quarter, balling like Kobe\n[01:33.50]I'm super clutchin' like Ginóbili\n[01:35.98]Time is money, so I went and got a rollie\n[01:39.44]New girl looking like a trophy\n[01:42.28]She do the cocaine till her nose bleed (Nose bleed, nose bleed)\n[01:45.96]And she don't even know me (And she don't know me, know me)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:49.16]They sing the right songs, they just hit the wrong notes\n[01:52.26]Remember old days when I had my heart broke\n[01:55.32]And now I'm in the stu' and I love to spit dope\n[01:58.34]My brother in the trap and he love to fix dope\n[02:01.42]These niggas never change, I could never fix broke (Fix broke)\n[02:04.62]I run up on his ass, get to shootin', Rambo (Rambo)\n[02:07.62]I know some niggas brazy, they red like Elmo (Like Elmo)\n[02:10.58]I'm sticking to the money like I got velcro (Velcro)\n[02:13.66]You say you getting money, but I know it's, \"Hell no\"\n[02:16.74]You don't got no Adidas, but I give you shell toes (Shell toes)\n[02:19.80]I'm balling like Shaquille, I'ma throw an elbow (Ayy)\n[02:23.10]You don't get no birds like a fucking scarecrow\n[Chorus]\n[02:25.18]She told me she in love with the old me\n[02:28.94]But I don't love the old me\n[02:31.06]In the fourth quarter, balling like Kobe\n[02:34.66]I'm super clutchin' like Ginóbili\n[02:37.10]Time is money, so I went and got a rollie\n[02:40.60]New girl looking like a trophy\n[02:43.42]She do the cocaine till her nose bleed (Nose bleed, nose bleed)\n[02:47.22]And she don't even know me (And she don't even know me, know me)\n[Outro]\n[02:54.12]I don't love the old me\n[03:00.40]Balling like Kobe\n[03:01.36]Ginóbili","words":[[2.72,2.82,"So"],[3.2,4.42,"alone"],[6.52,6.7,"Count"],[6.76,6.84,"the"],[6.96,7.24,"money"],[7.34,7.46,"while"],[7.5,7.54,"my"],[7.72,8.16,"lonely"],[8.46,8.76,"(Money"],[8.84,9.08,"while"],[9.18,9.2,"my"],[9.26,9.42,"lonely)"],[9.46,9.46,"I"],[9.5,9.58,"ain't"],[9.62,9.9,"really"],[10.0,10.36,"fucking"],[10.42,10.54,"with"],[10.6,10.66,"the"],[10.7,10.9,"police"],[10.96,10.96,"(I"],[11.0,11.14,"ain't"],[11.18,11.42,"really"],[11.54,11.94,"fucking"],[11.98,12.06,"with"],[12.1,12.18,"the"],[12.3,12.76,"police)"],[12.82,12.86,"And"],[12.9,12.98,"you"],[13.06,13.24,"know"],[13.32,13.32,"I"],[13.44,13.64,"keep"],[13.72,13.86,"it"],[13.94,14.02,"on"],[14.18,14.26,"me"],[14.32,14.36,"(And"],[14.42,14.48,